  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Kort sagt er eg den personlege assistenten og den høgre handa di.<br/>Klar når du er det.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Hei, eg er Cortana.<br/>Eg er her for å gjere ting enklare og hjelpe deg med å få gjort ting.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Cortana er den høgre handa di, klar til å hjelpe til med alt som gjer at du held deg på topp, eller rett og slett i tide.<br/><br/>Microsoft samlar inn og bruker plasseringa di, kontaktane dine, taleinndata, tale- og handskriftsmønster, skrivingshistorikk, søkjeloggen, kalenderdetaljar, innhald og loggdata frå meldingar og appar og annan informasjon for at Cortana skal gi deg relevante forslag og opplevingar som er tilpassa deg. I Microsoft Edge samlar Cortana inn og bruker lesarloggen. Men du kan alltids velje kva Cortana skal hugse i notatblokka, og du kan deaktivere Cortana i Microsoft Edge.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Skriv inn passordet ditt
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: Av omsyn til tryggleiken oppgir du passordet ditt ein gong til.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
    Candidate Language=NN-NO: 2532485720
